# Optional — the Google Sign-In button hides itself when this is unset, so
# local dev works without it. Must be the SAME Client ID as GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
# in services/api/.env (see that file's comment for how to create one).
# Public value, not a secret — it's meant to be visible in browser JS; it
# only identifies which OAuth app is requesting sign-in, it doesn't
# authorize anything by itself.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
